{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32562","headline":"效陶 · 刘驾","name":"效陶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两曜无停驭，蓬壶应有墓。\n何况北邙山，只近市朝路。\n大恢生死网，飞走无逃处。\n白发忽已新，红颜岂如故。\n我有杯中物，可以消万虑。\n醉舞日婆娑，谁能记朝暮。\n如求神仙药，阶下亦种黍。\n但使长兀然，始见天地祖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32562.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32562","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}